{"id":"40c7a74954abdddccb812285ce869f2d9cea3254","axis":"silent","repo":"humhub/humhub","sha":"40c7a74954abdddccb812285ce869f2d9cea3254","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","lines":["@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@ HumHub Changelog"," "," 1.19.1 (Unreleased)"," -------------------","+- Fix #8622: Console `module/update`, `module/update-all`, `module/install` and `module/enable` failed the `requirements.php` check of modules depending on another module (e.g. \"You must first install and enable the Clean Theme module.\" for Clean Theme Pro), as other modules are not loaded in these commands since 1.19.0. Module dependencies declared in `module.json` (`humhub.modules`, optionally with a `minVersion`) are now checked from metadata only when a module is installed, updated or enabled (new `ModuleDependencyService`), and registered before `requirements.php` is evaluated; `module/update-all` checks them against the versions installed after all updates, skips updates whose dependencies stay unmet and updates dependencies first"," - Enh #8614: People cards: Twig template for additional card details via `'user' => ['peopleCardDetailsTemplate' => ...]` (one HTML block with the profile fields as variables, e.g. with links and `<br>`), shown below the selected \"Information 1-3\" fields"," - Enh #8612: Optional `Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only` header (`web.enableCspReportOnly`) to test a stricter policy; violations are logged as warnings, also reports from guests"," - Fix #8607: The two-step login picked a random user when the entered login was one user's username and another user's email"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/develop/module-development.md","lines":["@@ -92,7 +92,7 @@ Marketplace metadata."," | `version`     | yes      | `X.Y.Z` semver — only bumped on release                                    |"," | `name`        | yes      | Display name                                                               |"," | `description` | yes      | One-line description                                                       |","-| `humhub`      | no       | `minVersion` and `maxVersion` core compatibility                           |","+| `humhub`      | no       | `minVersion` and `maxVersion` core compatibility, `modules` [dependencies](#module-dependencies) |"," | `keywords`    | no       | Array of keywords for marketplace search                                   |"," | `screenshots` | no       | Screenshot file names, relative to [`Module::$resourcesPath`](module-base-class.md#resourcespath) |"," | `homepage`    | no       | Module homepage URL                                                        |","@@ -126,6 +126,24 @@ Example:"," "," Bump `minVersion` whenever you start relying on a feature that arrived in a newer core version, and test against the supported range. When unsure, use the version you're developing against."," ","+#### Module dependencies","+","+A module that needs other modules declares them under `humhub.modules`, optionally with a minimum version:","+","+```json","+\"humhub\": {","+    \"minVersion\": \"1.19.1\",","+    \"modules\": {","+        \"calendar\": {},","+        \"clean-theme\": { \"minVersion\": \"2.5.1\" }","+    }","+}","+```","+","+Each dependency must be installed and enabled — and installed in at least `minVersion` — before the module can be installed, updated or enabled. The check only reads metadata (the `module_enabled` table and the dependencies' `module.json`), so it works the same in the web application and in the `module/*` console commands, which do not load third-party modules. `php yii module/update-all` checks the dependencies against the versions installed once all updates are applied and updates dependencies first.","+","+Declare dependencies here instead of checking them in `requirements.php` via `Yii::$app->getModule()`. Keep `requirements.php` for anything else, e.g. a required PHP extension.","+"," ### `Module.php`"," "," The module class hosts install/uninstall logic and module-level configuration. See [Module Class](module-base-class.md) for details."],"additions":19,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/develop/module-lifecycle.md","lines":["@@ -21,8 +21,9 @@ A module starts inert. To make it do anything, enable it via:"," "," Enabling will:"," ","-1. run all of the module's [database migrations](concept-models.md#initial-migration)","-2. insert a row into `module_enabled`","+1. check the module's [dependencies](module-development.md#module-dependencies) and its `requirements.php`, if any","+2. run all of the module's [database migrations](concept-models.md#initial-migration)","+3. insert a row into `module_enabled`"," "," The `ModuleManager` fires:"," "],"additions":3,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/develop/module-migrate-1.19.md","lines":["@@ -409,3 +409,32 @@ Breaking changes, new APIs and deprecations of the 1.19 release cycle.","   `humhub\\modules\\user\\authclient\\Password::ID`. Form-based auth clients may override the new","   `BaseFormClient::findUserByLogin(string $login): ?User` hook to change how the submitted login","   (username or email) is resolved; the default keeps the `user_source = <client ID>` filter.","+","+- **Since 1.19.1, module dependencies declared in `module.json` are checked.** A module lists the","+  modules it needs under `humhub.modules`, optionally with a minimum version — the format some","+  modules already used:","+","+  ```json","+  \"humhub\": {","+      \"minVersion\": \"1.19.1\",","+      \"modules\": {","+          \"clean-theme\": { \"minVersion\": \"2.5.1\" }","+      }","+  }","+  ```","+","+  Installing, updating (marketplace and `module/install`, `module/update`) and enabling a module","+  fails while a dependency is not installed and enabled, or installed in a lower version. New:","+  `humhub\\services\\ModuleDependencyService`. The check reads only metadata, no module class is","+  loaded, so it also works in the `module/*` console commands, which load no third-party modules","+  since 1.19 (`#[WithoutModuleAutoload]`) — there `Yii::$app->getModule()` in a `requirements.php`","+  returns `null` for every third-party module. `module/update-all` downloads all packages first,","+  checks their dependencies against the versions installed once all updates are applied, skips","+  the updates whose dependencies stay unmet and updates dependencies first.","+  - **Recommended:** move dependency checks from `requirements.php` (`Yii::$app->getModule('x')?->isEnabled`,","+    `version_compare(...->getVersion(), ...)`) to `humhub.modules` and keep `requirements.php`","+    for anything else. Until then, the declared dependencies are registered before","+    `requirements.php` is evaluated, so such a check also works in the console commands — a","+    dependency that is not declared is not.","+  - Modules that already declare `humhub.modules` get it enforced; make sure every listed module","+    is really required."],"additions":29,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"protected/humhub/modules/marketplace/commands/MarketplaceController.php","lines":["@@ -12,6 +12,7 @@"," use humhub\\components\\Module;"," use humhub\\models\\ModuleEnabled;"," use humhub\\modules\\admin\\libs\\HumHubAPI;","+use humhub\\services\\ModuleDependencyService;"," use humhub\\services\\ModuleDiscoveryService;"," use humhub\\services\\ModuleService;"," use Yii;","@@ -220,6 +221,10 @@ public function actionUpdate(string $moduleId)"," ","     /**","      * Updates all modules to the latest available version.","+     *","+     * All packages are downloaded first and their module dependencies are checked against the","+     * versions installed once all updates are applied (see {@see planUpdates()}). Modules are then","+     * updated so that each one comes after the modules it depends on.","      */","     public function actionUpdateAll()","     {","@@ -235,7 +240,7 @@ public function actionUpdateAll()","             $this->stdout('Found ' . count($updates) . ' module(s) with available updates.' . PHP_EOL);"," ","             $succeeded = 0;","-            foreach ($updates as $moduleId => $info) {","+            foreach ($this->planUpdates(array_keys($updates)) as $moduleId) {","                 $this->stdout(PHP_EOL . '── ' . $moduleId . ' ──' . PHP_EOL, Console::BOLD);","                 try {","                     $this->actionUpdate($moduleId);","@@ -277,6 +282,49 @@ public function actionUpdateAll()","         return 0;","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * Downloads the given module updates and returns the ones to apply, in dependency order.","+     *","+     * An update is skipped when the module dependencies of its new version are not met, even","+     * after all other updates are applied. Skipping an update may in turn leave the dependencies","+     * of another one unmet, so the check repeats until no more updates are skipped.","+     *","+     * @param string[] $moduleIds","+     * @return string[]","+     */","+    private function planUpdates(array $moduleIds): array","+    {","+        $onlineModuleManager = $this->getMarketplaceModule()->onlineModuleManager;","+","+        $packages = [];","+        foreach ($moduleIds as $moduleId) {","+            try {","+                $packages[$moduleId] = $onlineModuleManager->getPackageModuleInfo($moduleId);","+            } catch (\\Throwable $e) {","+                $this->error('Update of ' . $moduleId . ' failed: ' . $e->getMessage());","+            }","+        }","+","+        do {","+            $plannedVersions = array_filter(array_map(","+                static fn(array $moduleInfo) => $moduleInfo['version'] ?? null,","+                $packages,","+            ));","+","+            $skipped = false;","+            foreach ($packages as $moduleId => $moduleInfo) {","+                $unmetDependencies = (new ModuleDependencyService($moduleInfo, $plannedVersions))->getUnmetDependencies();","+                if ($unmetDependencies !== []) {","+                    $this->error('Update of ' . $moduleId . ' skipped: ' . implode(' ', $unmetDependencies));","+                    unset($packages[$moduleId]);","+                    $skipped = true;","+                }","+            }","+        } while ($skipped);","+","+        return ModuleDependencyService::sortByDependencies($packages);","+    }","+","     /**","      * Enables an installed module.","      *"],"additions":49,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"protected/humhub/modules/marketplace/components/OnlineModuleManager.php","lines":["@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@"," use humhub\\components\\ModuleEvent;"," use humhub\\models\\ModuleEnabled;"," use humhub\\modules\\admin\\libs\\HumHubAPI;","+use humhub\\services\\ModuleDependencyService;"," use humhub\\services\\ModuleDiscoveryService;"," use humhub\\services\\ModuleService;"," use humhub\\modules\\marketplace\\models\\Module as ModelModule;","@@ -25,6 +26,7 @@"," use yii\\base\\Exception;"," use yii\\base\\InvalidConfigException;"," use yii\\helpers\\FileHelper;","+use yii\\helpers\\Json;"," use yii\\web\\HttpException;"," use yii\\web\\ServerErrorHttpException;"," use ZipArchive;","@@ -133,6 +135,16 @@ private function unzip($file, $folder)"," ","     private function checkRequirements($moduleId, $moduleZipFile)","     {","+        $dependencyService = new ModuleDependencyService($this->readPackageModuleInfo($moduleId, $moduleZipFile));","+        $unmetDependencies = $dependencyService->getUnmetDependencies();","+        if ($unmetDependencies !== []) {","+            $this->throwError($moduleId, implode(' ', $unmetDependencies));","+        }","+","+        // Lets a requirements.php that checks its dependencies via Yii::$app->getModule() also work","+        // in console commands, which do not load third-party modules","+        $dependencyService->registerDependencies();","+","         $zip = new ZipArchive();","         $zip->open($moduleZipFile);","         if ($zip->locateName($moduleId . '/requirements.php')) {","@@ -143,6 +155,40 @@ private function checkRequirements($moduleId, $moduleZipFile)","         }","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * Downloads the latest compatible version of a module and returns the `module.json` of the package.","+     *","+     * The download is kept, so a following {@see install()} or {@see update()} of the same version","+     * does not download it again.","+     *","+     * @return array the `module.json` contents, an empty array if the package has none","+     * @throws ServerErrorHttpException","+     * @since 1.19.1","+     */","+    public function getPackageModuleInfo(string $moduleId): array","+    {","+        return $this->readPackageModuleInfo($moduleId, $this->downloadModule($moduleId));","+    }","+","+    private function readPackageModuleInfo(string $moduleId, string $moduleZipFile): array","+    {","+        $zip = new ZipArchive();","+        if ($zip->open($moduleZipFile) !== true) {","+            return [];","+        }","+","+        $moduleJson = $zip->getFromName($moduleId . '/module.json');","+        $zip->close();","+","+        try {","+            $moduleInfo = $moduleJson !== false ? Json::decode($moduleJson) : [];","+        } catch (\\Throwable) {","+            $moduleInfo = [];","+        }","+","+        return is_array($moduleInfo) ? $moduleInfo : [];","+    }","+","     private function downloadModule($moduleId): string","     {","         $moduleInfo = $this->getModuleInfo($moduleId);"],"additions":46,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"protected/humhub/services/ModuleDependencyService.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,218 @@","+<?php","+","+/*","+ * @link https://www.humhub.org/","+ * @copyright Copyright (c) 2026 HumHub GmbH & Co. KG","+ * @license https://www.humhub.com/licences","+ */","+","+namespace humhub\\services;","+","+use humhub\\models\\ModuleEnabled;","+use Yii;","+use yii\\helpers\\Json;","+","+/**","+ * Checks the modules a module depends on, as declared in its `module.json`:","+ *","+ * ```json","+ * \"humhub\": {","+ *     \"minVersion\": \"1.19.1\",","+ *     \"modules\": {","+ *         \"clean-theme\": { \"minVersion\": \"2.5.1\" }","+ *     }","+ * }","+ * ```","+ *","+ * A dependency is met when the module is installed and enabled and, if a `minVersion` is given,","+ * installed in at least that version.","+ *","+ * The check only reads metadata (the `module_enabled` table and the `module.json` files on disk),","+ * no module class is loaded. So it gives the same result in the web application and in console","+ * commands that do not load third-party modules ({@see \\humhub\\components\\console\\WithoutModuleAutoload}),","+ * and it never brings an outdated module class into the process before that module is updated.","+ *","+ * @since 1.19.1","+ */","+class ModuleDependencyService","+{","+    /**","+     * @var array<string, array{basePath: string, version: string|null, name: string|null}>|null","+     */","+    private ?array $installedModules = null;","+","+    /**","+     * @param array $moduleInfo the `module.json` contents of the module whose dependencies are checked","+     * @param array<string, string> $plannedVersions versions installed modules will have once a pending","+     * batch of updates is applied (moduleId => version), to check against that target state instead","+     * of the current one","+     */","+    public function __construct(private readonly array $moduleInfo, private readonly array $plannedVersions = [])","+    {","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * Creates the service for the module installed at the given path.","+     */","+    public static function forModulePath(string $basePath): self","+    {","+        $moduleJsonPath = $basePath . DIRECTORY_SEPARATOR . 'module.json';","+","+        try {","+            $moduleInfo = is_file($moduleJsonPath) ? Json::decode(file_get_contents($moduleJsonPath)) : [];","+        } catch (\\Throwable) {","+            $moduleInfo = [];","+        }","+","+        return new self(is_array($moduleInfo) ? $moduleInfo : []);","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * Returns the declared dependencies.","+     *","+     * @return array<string, array{minVersion?: string}> map of moduleId => constraints","+     */","+    public function getDependencies(): array","+    {","+        return self::readDependencies($this->moduleInfo);","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * Returns a message for each dependency that is not met, an empty array if all are met.","+     *","+     * @return string[]","+     */","+    public function getUnmetDependencies(): array","+    {","+        $messages = [];","+        $enabledIds = ModuleEnabled::getEnabledIds();","+        $coreModulePath = Yii::getAlias(ModuleDiscoveryService::CORE_MODULE_PATH) . DIRECTORY_SEPARATOR;","+","+        foreach ($this->getDependencies() as $moduleId => $constraints) {","+            $installed = $this->getInstalledModules()[$moduleId] ?? null;","+            $moduleName = $installed['name'] ?? $moduleId;","+","+            // Core modules are always enabled and have no entry in `module_enabled`","+            $isEnabled = $installed !== null","+                && (in_array($moduleId, $enabledIds, true) || str_starts_with($installed['basePath'], $coreModulePath));","+","+            if (!$isEnabled) {","+                $messages[] = Yii::t('base', 'You must first install and enable the {moduleName} module.', [","+                    'moduleName' => $moduleName,","+                ]);","+                continue;","+            }","+","+            $version = $this->plannedVersions[$moduleId] ?? $installed['version'];","+            if (isset($constraints['minVersion']) && version_compare((string)$version, $constraints['minVersion'], '<')) {","+                $messages[] = Yii::t('base', 'You must first upgrade the {moduleName} module to version {version} or later.', [","+                    'moduleName' => $moduleName,","+                    'version' => $constraints['minVersion'],","+                ]);","+            }","+        }","+","+        return $messages;","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * Registers the enabled dependencies that are not registered yet.","+     *","+     * Console commands without module autoload only register core modules, but a module's","+     * `requirements.php` may still check its dependencies via `Yii::$app->getModule()`. Only the","+     * declared dependencies are registered, after {@see getUnmetDependencies()} confirmed they are","+     * installed in a suitable version. A dependency that cannot be registered (e.g. a stale config","+     * referencing removed core classes) is skipped.","+     */","+    public function registerDependencies(): void","+    {","+        $dependencies = $this->getDependencies();","+        $enabledIds = ModuleEnabled::getEnabledIds();","+","+        foreach (ModuleDiscoveryService::locateModuleConfigs() as $basePath => $config) {","+            $moduleId = $config['id'] ?? null;","+            if (","+                $moduleId === null","+                || !isset($dependencies[$moduleId])","+                || !in_array($moduleId, $enabledIds, true)","+                || Yii::$app->moduleManager->hasModule($moduleId)","+            ) {","+                continue;","+            }","+","+            try {","+                Yii::$app->moduleManager->register($basePath, $config);","+            } catch (\\Throwable $e) {","+                Yii::warning('Could not load config for module \"' . $moduleId . '\": ' . $e->getMessage(), 'module');","+            }","+        }","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * Orders modules so that each one comes after the modules it depends on.","+     *","+     * Only dependencies between the given modules are taken into account, otherwise the given","+     * order is kept. Modules depending on each other in a cycle are all returned, in no particular","+     * order among themselves.","+     *","+     * @param array<string, array> $moduleInfos map of moduleId => `module.json` contents","+     * @return string[] the module ids in order","+     */","+    public static function sortByDependencies(array $moduleInfos): array","+    {","+        $sorted = [];","+        $visiting = [];","+","+        $visit = static function (string $moduleId) use (&$visit, &$sorted, &$visiting, $moduleInfos): void {","+            if (isset($sorted[$moduleId]) || isset($visiting[$moduleId])) {","+                return;","+            }","+","+            $visiting[$moduleId] = true;","+            foreach (array_keys(self::readDependencies($moduleInfos[$moduleId])) as $dependencyId) {","+                if (isset($moduleInfos[$dependencyId])) {","+                    $visit($dependencyId);","+                }","+            }","+            unset($visiting[$moduleId]);","+","+            $sorted[$moduleId] = true;","+        };","+","+        foreach (array_keys($moduleInfos) as $moduleId) {","+            $visit((string)$moduleId);","+        }","+","+        return array_map('strval', array_keys($sorted));","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * @return array<string, array{minVersion?: string}>","+     */","+    private static function readDependencies(array $moduleInfo): array","+    {","+        $modules = $moduleInfo['humhub']['modules'] ?? [];","+        if (!is_array($modules)) {","+            return [];","+        }","+","+        $dependencies = [];","+        foreach ($modules as $moduleId => $constraints) {","+            if (!is_string($moduleId) || $moduleId === '') {","+                continue;","+            }","+","+            $dependencies[$moduleId] = [];","+            if (is_array($constraints) && isset($constraints['minVersion']) && is_scalar($constraints['minVersion'])) {","+                $dependencies[$moduleId]['minVersion'] = (string)$constraints['minVersion'];","+            }","+        }","+","+        return $dependencies;","+    }","+","+    private function getInstalledModules(): array","+    {","+        return $this->installedModules ??= ModuleDiscoveryService::findInstalledModules();","+    }","+}"],"additions":218,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"protected/humhub/services/ModuleDiscoveryService.php","lines":["@@ -100,7 +100,7 @@ public static function findMigrationPaths(string $coreBasePath): array","      *","      * No module config.php is loaded. Modules without a module.json are ignored.","      *","-     * @return array<string, array{basePath: string, version: string|null}> map of moduleId => metadata","+     * @return array<string, array{basePath: string, version: string|null, name: string|null}> map of moduleId => metadata","      */","     public static function findInstalledModules(): array","     {","@@ -120,6 +120,7 @@ public static function findInstalledModules(): array","                         $modules[$moduleId] = [","                             'basePath' => $moduleDir,","                             'version' => $info['version'] ?? null,","+                            'name' => $info['name'] ?? null,","                         ];","                     }","                 } catch (\\Throwable) {"],"additions":2,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"protected/humhub/services/ModuleService.php","lines":["@@ -178,6 +178,18 @@ public function remove(bool $disableBeforeRemove = true): ?string","      */","     public function checkRequirements(): void","     {","+        $dependencyService = ModuleDependencyService::forModulePath($this->module->getBasePath());","+        $unmetDependencies = $dependencyService->getUnmetDependencies();","+        if ($unmetDependencies !== []) {","+            $message = implode(' ', $unmetDependencies);","+            Yii::error('Error enabling the \"' . $this->module->id . '\" module: ' . $message, 'module');","+            throw new ServerErrorHttpException($message);","+        }","+","+        // Lets a requirements.php that checks its dependencies via Yii::$app->getModule() also work","+        // in console commands, which do not load third-party modules","+        $dependencyService->registerDependencies();","+","         $requirementsPath = $this->module->getBasePath() . DIRECTORY_SEPARATOR . 'requirements.php';","         if (!file_exists($requirementsPath)) {","             return;"],"additions":12,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"protected/humhub/tests/codeception/_data/ModuleDependencies/child/config.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@","+<?php","+","+/*","+ * @link      https://www.humhub.org/","+ * @copyright Copyright (c) 2026 HumHub GmbH & Co. KG","+ * @license   https://www.humhub.com/licences","+ */","+","+return [","+    'id' => 'dep-child',","+    'class' => \\humhub\\components\\Module::class,","+];"],"additions":12,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"protected/humhub/tests/codeception/_data/ModuleDependencies/child/module.json","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@","+{","+    \"id\": \"dep-child\",","+    \"version\": \"1.0.0\",","+    \"name\": \"Dependency Child\",","+    \"description\": \"Fixture module for module dependency tests.\",","+    \"humhub\": {","+        \"minVersion\": \"1.19\",","+        \"modules\": {","+            \"dep-parent\": {","+                \"minVersion\": \"2.1.0\"","+            }","+        }","+    }","+}"],"additions":14,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"protected/humhub/tests/codeception/_data/ModuleDependencies/other/config.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@","+<?php","+","+/*","+ * @link      https://www.humhub.org/","+ * @copyright Copyright (c) 2026 HumHub GmbH & Co. KG","+ * @license   https://www.humhub.com/licences","+ */","+","+return [","+    'id' => 'dep-other',","+    'class' => \\humhub\\components\\Module::class,","+];"],"additions":12,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"protected/humhub/tests/codeception/_data/ModuleDependencies/other/module.json","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@","+{","+    \"id\": \"dep-other\",","+    \"version\": \"1.0.0\",","+    \"name\": \"Dependency Other\",","+